    },
    "id": "rORGtcPeWvJq",
    "outputId": "09ca24fb-7bdc-4e2e-98d8-f9dc8f43a40e"
   },
   "source": [
    "1) We estimated the age and metallicity of NGC 4147 to be:\n",
    "- (1.3 ± 0.2) × $10^{10}$ years\n",
    "-  −1.8 dex\n",
    "\n",
    "These values are based on CMD analysis and isochrone fitting, and are consistent with previous studies.\n",
